### Likely cause

`symbolfacts.RegisterPositional` is called only from the `init` of `internal/frontend/symbolfacts/positional`. That package is imported by `internal/frontend/grpc/positional.go` and `internal/frontend/repl/replext/positional`, and `cmd/sysml-wasm` imports neither:

```
$ GOOS=js GOARCH=wasm go list -deps ./cmd/sysml-wasm | grep symbolfacts
github.com/Open-MBEE/OpenSysML/internal/frontend/symbolfacts
