KerML 1.1 Beta 2 §8.4.4.6.2 says the ends of a binding connector "identify the same things (have the same values)". SysML 2.1 Beta 2 §7.13.2 says the related elements of a connection usage are the features its end features reference, so `i.a` and `i.b` are `s.src` and `k.dst`, which the instance IDs above also show.

