    satisfy requirement check : Full by vehicle1 {
        attribute redefines vehicle1.fuel = 1300;
    }
}
```

```text
$ sysml -strict -validate model.sysml
✓ package ChainProbe
✓ model.sysml: no errors

$ sysml -strict -satisfy model.sysml
✓ package ChainProbe
