  Required condition evaluated to false: vehicle.fuel == target
  standing: violated (witnessed: 1 run under reverse)
```

The REPL reproduces the same behavior:

```text
$ sysml -strict model.sysml
%instantiate ChainProbe::vehicle1
%features ChainProbe::vehicle1
%satisfy
```

`%features` reports `fuel = 0`, and `%satisfy` reports the failure above.

